output for the UMD pass\n\nFixes Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization#177\n\n## Reproduction before the fix\n1. Configure a pipeline stage that uploads to YouTube while signed out.\n2. Click `Run` without first clicking the YouTube button.\n3. The browser flow only opened the authorization modal and aborted, requiring another click before the pipeline could proceed.\n\n## Testing\n- PASS: `npm test -- --runInBand` (354 tests)\n- PASS: `npm run typecheck`\n- PASS: `npm run lint`\n- PASS: `npm run build` (previous module/declaration warnings removed)\n- PASS: new Cypress browser authorization regression reaches Google OAuth directly from `Run`\n- PASS: updated Cypress Electron regression reaches desktop OAuth directly from `Run`\n- PARTIAL: full `cypress/e2e/pipeline-mode.cy.js` run (32-33/40 passed); current `main` retains unrelated timing/UI failures in stage navigation, reset/date interactions, and render/review stubs. Logs were preserved locally during investigation.\n","created_at":"2026-06-23T03:54:26Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T01:42:48Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"dbe61b1aac6f2856d86bf5dd59235b8ea61f3559","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization/pulls/178/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization/pulls/178/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization/issues/178/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization/statuses/ec13e060e93430b93c636001498207f61ed050a2","head":{"label":"konard:issue-177-9abeda2579e9","ref":"issue-177-9abeda2579e9","sha":"ec13e060e93430b93c636001498207f61ed050a2","user":{"logi